OL,3,C#5,000 charge to run for Scottish
OL,4,CLabour leadership
OL,6,FCandidates standing to be the next
OL,7,FScottish Labour leader must pay #5,000
OL,8,Fto enter the contest.
OL,10,FThe charge is a significant increase
OL,11,Fon the 2021 cost of #3,000 when Anas
OL,12,FSarwar defeated Monica Lennon to take
OL,13,Fcharge.
OL,15,FIt cost #1,500 to enter both the 2017
OL,16,Frace that saw Richard Leonard defeat
OL,17,FMr Sarwar, and the 2015 poll where
OL,18,FKezia Dugdale saw off a challenge from
OL,19,FKen Macintosh.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/8
