PN,32502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786128505
OL,3,C#5,000 charge to run for Scottish
OL,4,CLabour leadership
OL,6,FCandidates are told the money covers
OL,7,Fthe cost of producing a "candidate
OL,8,Fbooklet" and allows access to lists of
OL,9,Fthe party's membership, "affiliates"
OL,10,Fand local Constituency Labour Parties
OL,11,F(CLPs).
OL,13,FNeither the SNP nor the Scottish
OL,14,FConservatives charge candidates to
OL,15,Fstand for the leadership of their
OL,16,Frespective parties.
OL,26,@oD@YOUpD@HO]qD@YOUqD@dO]
