OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786128505
OL,3,C#5,000 charge to run for Scottish
OL,4,CLabour leadership
OL,6,FMs Lennon is one of three MSPs vying
OL,7,Fto replace Mr Sarwar, who quit
OL,8,Fsuddenly last month to take a
OL,9,Fministerial role in the UK Government
OL,10,Fas part of Prime Minister Andy
OL,11,FBurnham's first reshuffle.
OL,13,FHe will be made a member of the House
OL,14,Fof Lords in order to take up the post.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
