CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786128505
OL,3,C#5,000 charge to run for Scottish
OL,4,CLabour leadership
OL,6,FSouth Scotland MSP Joe Fagan and North
OL,7,FEast MSP Michael Marra have both
OL,8,Fsecured nominations from enough
OL,9,Fparliamentarians to progress in the
OL,10,Fcontest while Ms Lennon, who replaced
OL,11,FMr Sarwar on the Glasgow regional list
OL,12,Fwhen he quit Holyrood, is currently
OL,13,Fshort of the required number.
OL,15,FCandidates also need the backing of at
OL,16,Fleast two trade unions and either a
OL,17,FCLP or "affiliate" by the time
OL,18,Fnominations close on August 17.
OL,26,@yD@HOUyD@RO]
