OL,3,C#5,000 charge to run for Scottish
OL,4,CLabour leadership
OL,6,FThe result will be announced on
OL,7,FSeptember 19, meaning the new leader
OL,8,Fwill be in place for the party's UK
OL,9,Fconference.
OL,11,FFormer Scottish Labour General
OL,12,FSecretary Michael Sharpe said: "From
OL,13,Fthe uninspiring failure of a manifesto
OL,14,Fto the former leader's undignified and
OL,15,Fembarrassing departure to the Lords,
OL,16,Fthere's not been a lot for Scottish
OL,17,FLabour members to be inspired by of
OL,18,Flate.
OL,26,@tD@`OU
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786128505
OL,3,C#5,000 charge to run for Scottish
OL,4,CLabour leadership
OL,6,F"Seeing that candidates are being
OL,7,Fsqueezed for thousands of pounds to
OL,8,Fstand in our latest leadership contest
OL,9,Fwill do nothing to give the membership
OL,10,Fany sense of relief that our party is
OL,11,Freconnecting with reality.
OL,13,F"Given the state the party is in, the
OL,14,Froute to stand in the contest should
OL,15,Fbe about candidates' record, vision
OL,16,Fand an ambitious policy platform, not
OL,17,Fwhether they will stump up #5,000 or
OL,18,Fnot."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUzD@EO]
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
