FL,326,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1786128505
OL,3,C#5,000 charge to run for Scottish
OL,4,CLabour leadership
OL,6,FScottish Labour said much of the
OL,7,Fincrease in the fee was due to
OL,8,Finflation, with the Bank of England
OL,9,Finflation calculator showing the
OL,10,F#3,000 charged in 2021 would equate to
OL,11,Faround #4,000 in today's prices.
OL,13,FA party official also highlighted an
OL,14,Fincreased number of postal votes among
OL,15,Fmembers and pointed to the price of
OL,16,Fstamps having doubled over the last
OL,17,Ffive years.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/8
